xbrli:xbrl.in-capmkt:RelatedPartyTransactionExplana:
The Column pertaining to 'Value of the Related Party Transactions as approved by the Audit Committee' includes following limits approved by the Audit Committee:
Credit Limit - Rs. 25,000 Crores;
Participation in Debentures issued by the Company - Rs. 2,000 crores. Issuing & Paying agent for commercial paper issued by the Company- Rs. 0.20 crores.
